bad1287b6]\n - v4.6.dev2.official [7864ac801]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev.mono (bad1287b6) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.5599) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10750H CPU @ 2.60GHz (12 threads) - 15.76 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nError of  `ERROR: scene\\main\\canvas_item.cpp:177 - Condition \"!is_inside_tree()\" is true. Returning: Transform2D()` and `INTERNAL ERROR: Condition \"!is_inside_tree()\" is true. Returning: Transform2D()` get raised when switching scenes with a `MarginContainer` selected. I was able to breakpoint and it looks related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111095 at this line \n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/bad1287b62ea09d993fb178bb6b1a61c17ae725e/editor/scene/gui/margin_container_editor_plugin.cpp#L58\n\nSeemed harmless since nothing looked broken in the editor, but still annoying.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Add a `MarginContainer` to the current scene and select it\n2. Press the + on the scene tab bar to make a new scene and switch to it\n3. See  `ERROR: scene\\main\\canvas_item.cpp:177 - Condition \"!is_inside_tree()\" is true. Returning: Transform2D()` and `INTERNAL ERROR: Condition \"!is_inside_tree()\" is true. Returning: Transform2D()`\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[margin-error.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23506826/margin-error.zip)\nthough, the steps are simple enough to do from an empty project","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"htt